   an edge-to-edge band on the bar's top edge. Top corners follow the bar's radius, 1px bottom edge in the tone colour, full tint,
   padding 12 / 16, same icon and text. No side or top border. Gap to the button = 16 (8 bar gap + 8 margin). */
