95-
96:The screen audit fixes are applied in these pictures (checklist: `docs/renders/2026-11-01-fix-round/CHECKLIST.md`). Calling: no header Back from the call tap on; leave sheet and Releasing… over Ready; empty case → Release case; busy confirm / transfer read-only. Prescribe: SOS total in the medicine's unit, capsule doses without ½, dose error as field text, `d-disabled`, keyboard rule. Entry: terms line during Verifying / Checking, cooldown reads "Checking…", one header spacing for OTP, offer and unlock. Home: busy controls disabled, pinned Set availability, quiet "Stay signed in", 35:00 after adding time.
