2. **End availability — wrong bar-button size — should-fix.** It uses the default 48-high, 16/24 button. §9.1 requires every full-width bar action to be 56 high with an 18 semibold label. Use `--lg`.
3. **Profile icon — inconsistent glyph — should-fix.** The source uses `user`; approved Home uses the circled profile glyph. Restore the approved icon.
4. **Local styling — token compliance incomplete — should-fix.** Despite the brief’s description, the source contains unannotated raw dimensions and offsets, including logo width, wheel geometry and header negative margins. Use semantic tokens or permitted, documented exceptions. Capture-frame dimensions can remain review scaffolding.

**Pass:** neutral Tabler row icons, brand selection, white content card, divider, secondary-button treatment, quiet ending action, panel rounding and action-bar surface follow the system. The card retains `tm-card` radius and shadow; no invented colour treatment appears.

